\
  Roughly ~9,000 of the ~15,000 lines are reusable infrastructure. The other ~6,000 are the\
  enterprise-specific layer: prompts, queries, deliverable configs, result processing tuned for enterprise\
  outputs.\
\
  The cleanest architecture: Fork this repo as a starting point. Keep the infrastructure layer. Replace the\
  content layer (prompts, queries, guides, deliverable definitions, result processing). That way you're not\
  maintaining two codepaths in one codebase, and each app can evolve independently.\
