  He glosses over the "how" for non-technical owners. He talks about building these automations but doesn't\
  address the reality for most SMBs: the owner is the bottleneck and they're not technical. When he says\
  "you can build a speed to lead system," he's talking to someone who knows what an API is. Your clients\
  don't know what an API is. So the recommendations need to be more like:\
